Type: Project
Package: globalsoilfungi
Title: Global Maps of Soil Fungal Diversity, Ectomycorrhizal Structure and Taxonomic Resolution at 250 m
Version: 1.0.0
Description: R workflow supporting the global 250 m maps of six soil fungal
    community dimensions: covariate stack, response variables from GloSED,
    quantile random forest with spatial block validation, prediction with
    uncertainty, figures, tables and distribution copies.
